00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:56.010
We'll get it

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:56.490
fixed as quickly

00:22:56.490 --> 00:22:56.950
as possible.

00:22:57.070 --> 00:22:57.470
Yes, sir.

00:22:57.800 --> 00:22:59.540
Red, this is

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:00.000
all a plan

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.840
to blow up the Baratavia with a human torpedo

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:03.560
before the 620 comes out to protect her.

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:04.860
Well, we've got to warn the Baratavia.

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:06.130
There's only one chance.

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.320
We'll use the Mosquito Bolt.

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:14.150
When you get a direct line on the Baratavia,

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:16.740
pull that lever and jump for your life.

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.500
My life isn't worth much from now on.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:20.640
It's the Scorpion's orders.

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:22.440
Now get started.

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:32.190
The torpedo will follow the same course we're on.

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:33.690
So keep a sharp look out, Red.

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:52.500
Okay, now.

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:54.000
That's it, Red. Unlimber the gun.

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:54.480
Okay.

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:18.660
even did it. I know. Ramming's the only thing that'll stop him. Throw out that light belt

00:24:18.660 --> 00:24:21.980
red and jump in. Nothing doing. I'm sticking with you, Don. That's an order, Lieutenant

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:27.680
Pennington. My eyes are red.
